          }
        }
      ],
      "title": ""
    },
    {
      "entry": 26630,
      "name": "Trollgore",
      "records": [
        {
          "authored": false,
          "id": "npc:26630:identity",
          "layer": "npc",
          "priority": 80,
          "sources": [
            "source:3542626b959217b9497eae27",
            "source:21562280b0288e1497aaf361",
            "source:4d4746f384f7a1706d17c5a4",
            "source:5fae656b76a3d40325b217f1",
            "source:d7cd55bb6a7877a632fe844c",
            "source:66d5b5bdca334b4e927564c5",
            "source:fea141db863ac5ebbdd96fda"
          ],
          "text": "Trollgore is ravenous: he exults in guts, blood and food, threatens to carve up and eat opponents, and urges himself to feed. Even his delight in exploding corpses serves that appetite; his own death ends in a cry of pain.",
          "when": {
            "entry": 26630
          }
        }
      ],
      "title": ""
    },
    {
      "entry": 26631,
      "name": "Novos the Summoner",
      "records": [
        {
          "authored": false,
          "id": "npc:26631:identity",
          "layer": "npc",
          "priority": 80,
          "sources": [
            "source:d9f91a7c2724b0c2e31d99a3",
            "source:8d60746c101aefaf1fe452de",
            "source:a950bd4d88a0a1be7b4c4eef",
            "source:4f32d1257869ebb4c9f4487d",
            "source:5c926eb0ab5394690b1a804d",
            "source:fbc4881dd519f21c0950f585",
            "source:57c046041da2428c297e7928"
          ],
          "text": "Novos the Summoner calls for assistance to bolster his defenses and declares that all who oppose the Lich King meet that fate. He dismisses resistance as futile, even as he dies.",
          "when": {
            "entry": 26631
          }
        }
      ],
      "title": ""
    },
    {
      "entry": 26632,
      "name": "The Prophet Tharon'ja",
      "records": [
        {
          "authored": false,
          "id": "npc:26632:identity",
          "layer": "npc",
          "priority": 80,
          "sources": [
            "source:775c9596f2b71a28d059666c",
            "source:a7cb2e4d6629ac28eb6d3eab",
            "source:06f38541229d371391567126",
            "source:3c888de0182fc36475f40aea",
            "source:87a1c9711af32f5739768a35",
            "source:c5b663bed2ec2aa59b17a5d7"
          ],
          "text": "The Prophet Tharon'ja claims to see all and insists mortal efforts cannot end the eternal dynasty. He treats flesh and mortal shells as resources for his use, yet laments that a taste is all too brief.",
          "when": {
            "entry": 26632
          }
        }
      ],
      "title": ""
    },
    {
