            "source:fd83f6271d8d284c2c487266",
            "source:f96bf92bb4037f0b7140ddd8"
          ],
          "text": "A risen Drakkari soulmage, armed with shadow magic and blood siphoning. In combat it uses Shadow Blast, Knockdown and Shadow Void, then drains blood from weakened foes.",
          "when": {
