          "id": "npc:27871:identity",
          "layer": "npc",
          "priority": 80,
          "sources": [
            "source:44da1ef3ad245726aaba5700",
            "source:fbd615478e92a03b4b15f9e6",
            "source:07478c33715c12686ebbe5ec",
            "source:234acd0d5ea78de2beb5a597"
          ],
          "text": "A Flesheating Ghoul is an undead combatant found in Drak'Tharon. It can use Pierce Armor in combat and may go into a frenzy.",
